  "wasf": "The BepInEx redistributables, pinned by content hash. Mono components take BepInEx 5, which is what Unity 5.0-2021.3 Mono games load; IL2CPP components take BepInEx 6 pre-release, which is the only line with an IL2CPP loader and is what the Taarib.Unity.Il2cpp assembly targets. Each entry is a zip unpacked verbatim into its component directory. Neither archive carries a licence file of its own; assets/NOTICES.md is what discharges that obligation, and dropping it from a bundle makes the bundle non-redistributable.",
